#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye, kuri buri poller isoma amahuriro, igana ku rufunguzo rw'ibanga aho igice cyarwo rusange buri huriro rishyira muri authorized_keys hamwe n'itegeko ryahatirijwe ritangiza pfs-read.sh. Rusomwa gusa n'umukoresha wa poller. Umugereka ntuzigera uruhanga, urukopera cyangwa ngo urucape."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Dosiye y'urufunguzo rwa SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye igana kuri dosiye ya known_hosts ibitse urufunguzo rwa host rwa buri huriro munsi y'izina ry'aderesi y'ihuriro. Ihuriro urufunguzo rwaryo rubuze cyangwa rwahindutse ntirisomwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Dosiye ya known_hosts"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
