#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Amasegonda yo gutegereza ko ihuriro ryemera kwihuza."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gusoma"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Amasegonda igikorwa kimwe cyo gusoma ihuriro gishobora kumara yose hamwe mbere y'uko gihagarikwa kandi kikandikwa nk'icyanze."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB ihuriro rimwe rishobora kugarura. Igisubizo kinini kirajugunywa kandi kikandikwa nk'icyanze."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Igisubizo ntarengwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Umusomyi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Igihe cyagenewe umusomyi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Amasegonda igikorwa kimwe cy'umusomyi gishobora kumara mbere y'uko gihagarika gutangiza isoma ry'amahuriro. Kigumane munsi y'intera ya poller; amahuriro atasomwe asomwa mu gikorwa gikurikira."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Isoma ribangikanye"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Isoma ry'amahuriro umusomyi umwe akorera rimwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Iyo bishyizweho akamenyetso, gukuramo umugereka bigumana sisitemu z'amadosiye zawo, amahuriro, urutonde rw'ibikoresho, n'ububiko bw'agateganyo. Kura akamenyetso kugira ngo gukuramo bibisibe; banza wohereze hanze rejisitiri uvuye ku rupapuro rwa Parallel Filesystem Admin. Amahuriro yo kubika ntajya ahamagarwa mu buryo bwose."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Siba ibikoresho uyu mugereka wahanze igihe ukuwemo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Iyo bishyizweho akamenyetso, gukuramo umugereka bisiba ibikoresho wahanze kuri sisitemu z'amadosiye, hamwe n'ibishushanyo n'inkomoko z'amakuru byabyo, nk'uko kubisiba muri Cacti byagenda. Ibikoresho bisanzwe bihujwe na sisitemu y'amadosiye ntibijya bisibwa. Amadosiye ya RRD akurwaho gusa niba igenamiterere ryo gusukura RRD rya Cacti ubwaryo riyakuraho. Iyo akamenyetso kakuweho, ibikoresho biraguma."

